      "message": "Ok, you confused me more now.\n\nyou only want the values aka from your list:\n```\nbyte 1: number of attributes   // SKIP\nbyte 2: attr1                  // SKIP\nbyte 3: val1                   // GET\nbyte 4: attr2                  // SKIP\nbyte 5: val2                   // GET\n```\n\nWith the current solution you are skipping the first 2 but not the byte 4.\n\nDon\u0027t you want something like this:\n```\n  auto it \u003d begin() + VendorPacket::kMinSize();\n  uint8_t number_attributes \u003d (it++).extract8();\n  std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e values_list \u003d Vector_reserver(number_attributes);\n  while (number_attributes \u003e 0) {\n     ++it; // skip attribute_header since we only want the values\n     values_list.push_back(static_cast\u003cuint8_t\u003e((it++).extract8()));\n     --number_attributes;\n  }\n\n  ASSERT(it \u003d\u003d end()); // not sure we want to assert but this should be true\n```",
